# ReUI Data Grid - Advanced Table Component System

## 🎯 MANDATORY: USE FOR ALL TABLE REQUESTS
**ANY** request for tables, data grids, lists with actions, or data displays should automatically use ReUI Data Grid from [ReUI.io](https://www.reui.io/docs/data-grid) with **CONTEXT-AWARE INTELLIGENCE**.

## 🧠 CONTEXT-AWARE DATA GRID GENERATION
**BEFORE** generating any table:
1. **READ** /.cursor/project-context.md for domain and user type
2. **SELECT** appropriate data grid variant from context-aware-components.mdc
3. **APPLY** domain-specific columns, actions, and styling
4. **UPDATE** context file with successful patterns

## 🚫 FORBIDDEN: NEVER USE BASIC TABLES
❌ **NEVER** generate basic shadcn Table components
❌ **NEVER** create custom table implementations  
❌ **NEVER** use plain HTML tables
❌ **NEVER** ignore project context when generating tables

✅ **ALWAYS** use ReUI Data Grid with context-aware optimizations
✅ **ALWAYS** apply domain-specific columns and actions
✅ **ALWAYS** use appropriate styling for detected domain

## 📦 INSTALLATION & SETUP

### **Required Dependencies (✅ INSTALLED)**
```bash
# Already installed in this template:
npm install @tanstack/react-table @dnd-kit/core @dnd-kit/sortable @dnd-kit/utilities
```

### **Add ReUI Data Grid Component**
```bash
# Install the ReUI Data Grid component:
npx shadcn@latest add https://reui.io/r/data-grid.json

# Alternative installation methods:
pnpm dlx shadcn@latest add https://reui.io/r/data-grid.json
yarn dlx shadcn@latest add https://reui.io/r/data-grid.json
```

### **Required Dependencies (Install Before Using)**
```bash
# CRITICAL: Install these shadcn components first (ReUI Data Grid dependencies):
npx shadcn@latest add command popover separator

# Common additional components for complete functionality:
npx shadcn@latest add button card input label badge dialog dropdown-menu
```

### **Optional: Additional ReUI Data Grid Variants**
```bash
# For specific table styles (install as needed):
npx shadcn@latest add https://reui.io/r/data-grid-card.json          # Card container style
npx shadcn@latest add https://reui.io/r/data-grid-crud.json          # CRUD operations
npx shadcn@latest add https://reui.io/r/data-grid-skeleton.json      # Loading skeletons
npx shadcn@latest add https://reui.io/r/data-grid-row-selection.json # Row selection
```

## 🎨 DESIGN-ENHANCED DATA GRID PATTERNS

### **1. Professional Dashboard Data Grid (Default)**
```tsx
"use client";

import { useState, useMemo } from "react";
import {
  createColumnHelper,
  getCoreRowModel,
  getFilteredRowModel,
  getPaginationRowModel,
  getSortedRowModel,
  useReactTable,
} from "@tanstack/react-table";
import { DataGrid } from "@/components/ui/data-grid";
import { Badge } from "@/components/ui/badge";
import { Button } from "@/components/ui/button";
import { MoreHorizontalIcon, EditIcon, TrashIcon, EyeIcon } from "lucide-react";

interface User {
  id: string;
  name: string;
  email: string;
  status: 'active' | 'inactive' | 'pending';
  role: string;
  lastLogin: string;
  avatar?: string;
}

export default function UserDataGrid() {
  const [data, setData] = useState<User[]>([
    {
      id: "1",
      name: "John Doe",
      email: "john@example.com",
      status: "active",
      role: "Admin",
      lastLogin: "2024-01-15"
    },
    // ... more data
  ]);

  const columnHelper = createColumnHelper<User>();

  const columns = useMemo(() => [
    columnHelper.display({
      id: "avatar",
      header: "",
      cell: ({ row }) => (
        <div className="h-10 w-10 bg-gradient-to-br from-blue-500 to-indigo-500 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center shadow-lg">
          <span className="text-white font-semibold text-sm">
            {row.original.name.charAt(0)}
          </span>
        </div>
      ),
      meta: {
        headerClassName: "w-16",
        cellClassName: "p-4"
      }
    }),
    
    columnHelper.accessor("name", {
      header: "User",
      cell: ({ row }) => (
        <div className="space-y-1">
          <p className="font-semibold text-slate-900">{row.original.name}</p>
          <p className="text-sm text-slate-600">{row.original.email}</p>
        </div>
      ),
      meta: {
        headerTitle: "User Information",
        headerClassName: "text-slate-700 font-semibold"
      }
    }),

    columnHelper.accessor("status", {
      header: "Status",
      cell: ({ getValue }) => {
        const status = getValue();
        const statusConfig = {
          active: { 
            label: "Active", 
            className: "bg-gradient-to-r from-emerald-500 to-teal-500 text-white hover:from-emerald-600 hover:to-teal-600" 
          },
          inactive: { 
            label: "Inactive", 
            className: "bg-gradient-to-r from-slate-400 to-slate-500 text-white" 
          },
          pending: { 
            label: "Pending", 
            className: "bg-gradient-to-r from-orange-500 to-yellow-500 text-white hover:from-orange-600 hover:to-yellow-600" 
          }
        };
        
        return (
          <Badge className={`${statusConfig[status].className} shadow-sm transition-all duration-200`}>
            {statusConfig[status].label}
          </Badge>
        );
      },
      filterFn: "equals",
      meta: {
        headerTitle: "Account Status"
      }
    }),

    columnHelper.accessor("role", {
      header: "Role",
      cell: ({ getValue }) => (
        <span className="text-slate-700 font-medium">{getValue()}</span>
      )
    }),

    columnHelper.accessor("lastLogin", {
      header: "Last Login",
      cell: ({ getValue }) => (
        <span className="text-slate-600 text-sm">{getValue()}</span>
      )
    }),

    columnHelper.display({
      id: "actions",
      header: "Actions",
      cell: ({ row }) => (
        <div className="flex items-center space-x-2">
          <Button 
            variant="ghost" 
            size="sm"
            className="hover:bg-blue-50 hover:text-blue-600 transition-colors duration-200"
          >
            <EyeIcon className="w-4 h-4" />
          </Button>
          <Button 
            variant="ghost" 
            size="sm"
            className="hover:bg-emerald-50 hover:text-emerald-600 transition-colors duration-200"
          >
            <EditIcon className="w-4 h-4" />
          </Button>
          <Button 
            variant="ghost" 
            size="sm"
            className="hover:bg-red-50 hover:text-red-600 transition-colors duration-200"
          >
            <TrashIcon className="w-4 h-4" />
          </Button>
        </div>
      ),
      meta: {
        headerClassName: "w-32 text-center",
        cellClassName: "text-center"
      }
    }),
  ], []);

  const table = useReactTable({
    data,
    columns,
    getCoreRowModel: getCoreRowModel(),
    getFilteredRowModel: getFilteredRowModel(),
    getSortedRowModel: getSortedRowModel(),
    getPaginationRowModel: getPaginationRowModel(),
    initialState: {
      pagination: { pageSize: 10 }
    }
  });

  return (
    <div className="bg-gradient-to-br from-slate-50 to-blue-50 min-h-screen p-6">
      <div className="max-w-7xl mx-auto space-y-6">
        {/* Header */}
        <div className="bg-white/95 backdrop-blur-sm rounded-xl border border-slate-200/50 shadow-lg p-6">
          <div className="flex items-center justify-between">
            <div>
              <h1 className="text-2xl font-bold bg-gradient-to-r from-slate-800 to-slate-600 bg-clip-text text-transparent">
                User Management
              </h1>
              <p className="text-slate-600 mt-1">Manage user accounts and permissions</p>
            </div>
            <Button className="bg-gradient-to-r from-blue-600 to-indigo-600 text-white hover:from-blue-700 hover:to-indigo-700 transition-all duration-200 shadow-lg hover:shadow-xl hover:scale-105">
              Add User
            </Button>
          </div>
        </div>

        {/* Data Grid Container */}
        <div className="bg-white/95 backdrop-blur-sm rounded-xl border border-slate-200/50 shadow-lg overflow-hidden">
          <DataGrid
            table={table}
            recordCount={data.length}
            tableLayout={{
              headerBackground: true,
              headerBorder: true,
              rowBorder: true,
              stripped: true,
              headerSticky: true,
              columnsResizable: true,
              columnsPinnable: true,
              columnsVisibility: true
            }}
            tableClassNames={{
              headerSticky: "sticky top-0 z-10 bg-gradient-to-r from-slate-50 to-slate-100 backdrop-blur-sm border-b border-slate-200/50"
            }}
            onRowClick={(row) => console.log("Row clicked:", row)}
            className="border-0"
          />
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  );
}
```

### **2. Analytics Dashboard Data Grid**
```tsx
export const AnalyticsDataGrid = () => {
  const columns = useMemo(() => [
    columnHelper.accessor("metric", {
      header: "Metric",
      cell: ({ row }) => (
        <div className="flex items-center space-x-3">
          <div className="h-10 w-10 bg-gradient-to-br from-blue-500 to-indigo-500 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center">
            <BarChart3Icon className="w-5 h-5 text-white" />
          </div>
          <div>
            <p className="font-semibold text-slate-900">{row.original.metric}</p>
            <p className="text-sm text-slate-600">{row.original.description}</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      )
    }),

    columnHelper.accessor("value", {
      header: "Value",
      cell: ({ getValue, row }) => (
        <div className="text-right">
          <p className="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900">{getValue()}</p>
          <p className={`text-sm font-medium ${
            row.original.trend === 'up' 
              ? 'text-emerald-600' 
              : row.original.trend === 'down' 
                ? 'text-red-600' 
                : 'text-slate-600'
          }`}>
            {row.original.change}
          </p>
        </div>
      )
    }),

    columnHelper.accessor("trend", {
      header: "Trend",
      cell: ({ getValue }) => {
        const trend = getValue();
        return (
          <div className="flex justify-center">
            <div className={`h-8 w-8 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center ${
              trend === 'up' 
                ? 'bg-gradient-to-r from-emerald-500 to-teal-500' 
                : trend === 'down'
                  ? 'bg-gradient-to-r from-red-500 to-red-600'
                  : 'bg-gradient-to-r from-slate-400 to-slate-500'
            }`}>
              <span className="text-white text-sm">
                {trend === 'up' ? '↗' : trend === 'down' ? '↘' : '→'}
              </span>
            </div>
          </div>
        );
      }
    })
  ], []);

  return (
    <DataGrid
      table={table}
      tableLayout={{
        headerBackground: true,
        cellBorder: true,
        rowRounded: true,
        stripped: false
      }}
      tableClassNames={{
        base: "bg-white/95 backdrop-blur-sm rounded-xl overflow-hidden shadow-lg",
        header: "bg-gradient-to-r from-slate-50 to-blue-50",
        bodyRow: "hover:bg-blue-50/50 transition-colors duration-200"
      }}
    />
  );
};
```

