## ✅ QUALITY STANDARDS FOR DATA GRIDS

### **Import Validation (CRITICAL):**
- [ ] **All imports point to existing components** (verify before using)
- [ ] **Required shadcn dependencies installed** (command, popover, separator)
- [ ] **No unused imports** in the generated file
- [ ] **Proper import organization** (React → libraries → UI → icons → utils)
- [ ] **Correct import paths** using @/ aliases

### **Visual Excellence:**
- [ ] **Gradient header backgrounds** instead of plain colors
- [ ] **Hover effects** on all interactive elements (rows, buttons, cells)
- [ ] **Status badges** with appropriate gradient styling
- [ ] **Professional shadows** and glassmorphic effects
- [ ] **Smooth transitions** for all state changes (200-300ms)

### **Functionality Standards:**
- [ ] **Column sorting** enabled on relevant columns
- [ ] **Search/filtering** functionality included
- [ ] **Responsive design** that works on mobile
- [ ] **Loading states** with skeleton screens
- [ ] **Empty states** with helpful messaging and actions

### **Interaction Standards:**
- [ ] **Row click handlers** for navigation or details
- [ ] **Action buttons** with clear hover feedback
- [ ] **Keyboard navigation** support
- [ ] **Accessibility features** (ARIA labels, focus management)
- [ ] **Professional error handling** with user-friendly messages

